TTS backbone tokenizers, ported from codec.cpp's llama.cpp patches:
- soprano: upstream's (v0.8.0+), plus [UNK] as id 0 by default, since
  BricksDisplay/Soprano-1.1-80M-GGUF predates upstream's converter and lacks
  tokenizer.ggml.unknown_token_id.
- chatterbox (patches/chatterbox-tokenizer-llamacpp.patch): Chatterbox T3's
  text BPE behind HF's Whitespace pre-tokenizer
  (BricksDisplay/Chatterbox-Multilingual-TTS-GGUF since 2026-10-21).
- UGM byte fallback (patches/ugm-byte-fallback-llamacpp.patch): Pocket-TTS's
  SentencePiece vocab.
--- a/src/llama-vocab.h
+++ b/src/llama-vocab.h
@@ -74,6 +74,7 @@
     LLAMA_VOCAB_PRE_TYPE_DOMYN_SMALL       = 63,
     LLAMA_VOCAB_PRE_TYPE_NEMOTRON_3_5_EMBD = 64,
     LLAMA_VOCAB_PRE_TYPE_SOPRANO           = 65,
+    LLAMA_VOCAB_PRE_TYPE_CHATTERBOX        = 66,
 };
 
